tick=15 note two minutes on the wedge is past the grace, so the third gang's repair is selected; it would take a serving set offline, and the unavailability budget the open repair exhausts denies it, so no repair opens and the escalation parks the gang Failed naming the crash. The strategy is switched to a surge whose budget admits every start and the partition is lifted, so the first gang is a fresh start the budget admits; the pass is the repairs', so the start waits
